Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:48.90,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,54)\fad(200,0)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs34\c&H00DFB32B}Tom Piccirello (PostHog)
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:48.90,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“The annual pen test is
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:48.90,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}dead. Scan weekly, fix
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:48.90,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}automatically.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,But then the other
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:01.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,the next piece of that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:02.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think, is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.68,0:00:03.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the SRE world pre-AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,there was always this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:05.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,belief that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:08.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, we should find out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:09.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,if we go down before our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:10.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,customers tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:11.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,And I think the same is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,true of vulnerabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,We should identify the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerabilities before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:14.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,they're reported to us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:15.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a bug bounty or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,vulnerability disclosure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:18.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,program. And so really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:20.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,the key there is using
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,one or several AI red
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,teaming tools to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,constantly test your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:25.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,source code and your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,network to find these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,things and combine those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,findings with automatic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:30.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,remediation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:31.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,automatic PRs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.87,0:00:32.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:33.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,the annual pen test I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:34.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,think is completely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,dead. It was always
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,pretty useless
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:38.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,even with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:39.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Testing once a year just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,But more than ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:42.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,you should have weekly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:43.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,scans at a minimum
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:44.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,weekly in-depth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:45.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,high-token scans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:46.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you should be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:47.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,automatically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:48.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,remediating what gets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:48.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,found.
